{
  "id": "ISA.59",
  "number": "59",
  "bookId": "ISA",
  "reference": "Isaya 59",
  "verseCount": 21,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "59",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ISA 59"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "59",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 59:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Leba, obushobora bw'Omukama tibukakeyaga, kugir'oti tiyakurokora muntu. Takafaga na matwi kugamb'oti taina kuhulira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 59:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyonkai inywe amafu ganyu nigo gabatanisize na Ruhanga wanyu. Timukimubona aha rw'enshonga y'entambara zanyu, niyo nshonga atalikubahulira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 59:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwina ebishuba n'ebiboyo, kandi nimwita abantu, nimugamba kubi omu kanwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 59:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nimugya omw'iramuliro kugamba ebishuba, entoija yanyu ti ya mazima. Nimuhangilira, nimugamba ebitalibyo, nimutokya banu, muli omu kulimira abantu obwina. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 59:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nimwatira amahuli g'empili, nimuruka enju y'orububi. Alikulya amahuli gomwayatira afa, kandi eihuli lyomulikwata nilirugwamu enchwera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 59:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Embubi ezo barukire tiziibe myendo bakazijwara. Ebyo tulikukora tibabyeshweke. Ebikorwa byabo mafu gashai, nibaboya kushai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 59:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebibi nibyo tulikutegeka, nibategeka kwita abataina ntambara. Nibatekeleza amafu gonkai, okwita abantu bakababonabonia nikwo tulimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 59:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tibategeka bya milembe; n'ebyo tulikukora tibinamu mazima. Ebyo tulikukora bishobire; alikukora ebyo tainamu milembe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 59:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 59:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahanyuma nikwo abantu kugamba bati, “Tituli bantu ba mazima kandi tituli bagorogoki n'ak'okuziza. Nituhiga omushana kyonkai leba omwilima n'ekiire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 59:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nitukarakanja kuhiga mtuli orukuta ruli, nitukarakanja nk'abataina maisho. Nitusitara omw'ihangwe okw'obon'oti kalembabazana. Omuli tulinya abaina amani ichwe nitushusha abafire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 59:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nitusinda nk'edubu, nitutaganyia nk'obwiba. Tulebire Ruhanga nk'aratwihya omu naku kyonkai taliho shubi. Tulebire nk'araturokora byabura nshai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 59:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuba tukufakalire muno, waitu Mukama, amafu gaitu nigaturopa. Entambara zaitu nituzishobokerwa, amafu gaitu nitugamanya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 59:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tukakufakalira, twakwetonga, waitu Mukama Ruhanga twayanga kukugumaho, tukashasa abantu, na iwe twakugomera, twatekeleza ebishuba, nibyo tugamba byonkai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 59:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amazima tigakiliho, n'obugorogoki tibukimanyika n'akati. Ebilikukolerwa nyakabuga tibinamu mazima, n'obugorogoki tibukirangwamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 59:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obwesigwa tibukiliyo, nangu n'omuntu alikulekera kufakara, ababi nibamunoba.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 59:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebi byona Omukama yabiboine mara talikushemelerwa kubona amazima gataliho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 59:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaboine n'omuntu ow'okutelera banu omushango okwo atalikuzoka. Kityo wenene arakoza obushoborabwe abarokore mara asinge ababishabe. Obugorogokibwe nigo manige. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 59:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obugorogoki niyo ngabo y'ekyoma eyo alijwara omu kifuba, kandi okusinga ababishabe niyo helumeta eyo alijwara omu mutwe. Nagonza muno kutebekanisa ebintu, kubonabonia atulikushasa abantu, atulikubonesibwa enaku abeholere. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 59:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alibarongora kuhonderana n'ebikorwa byabo. Ababishabe ababonabonyie, ababuze emihanda. Nangu n'ensi ez'aharai alizigira atyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 59:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho ab'oburugaizoba tulitina Omukama, n'ab'obugwaizoba tulibona ekitinwakye. Alija nk'omugera ogw'engezi y'amani n'embuyaga omu kanya kamoi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 59:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 59:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama nagambira eihangalye ati, “Ndaija Sioni, nchungure ab'omu ka ya Yakobo bona abarayechuza entambara zabo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 59:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nashuba nagamba ati, “Egi niyo ndagano yange eyo ndakora na inywe: Obushobora bwange n'ebyo mbegesize, mwikarega nimubigamba n'abaana banyu, na baijukuru banyu, kwema mbwenu n'amakiro agalija.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
